Subject: [PATCH 2/2] kboot: T6050: also admit the M5 Max's 27.3 GPU build
 (aura #172)

joshuaswarren's aurora-silicon/aura #172 (60a3b0fdb3) accepts the 26C5035r digest he
measured on an M5 Max, normalized with the 27.0 record offsets. Our 27.3 hand-off keeps a
table of builds, so his digest goes in as one more entry rather than a second check.

Co-authored-by: Joshua Warren <816217+joshuaswarren@users.noreply.github.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/kboot_gpu.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/kboot_gpu.c b/src/kboot_gpu.c
index 90d6dba6..164569de 100644
--- a/src/kboot_gpu.c
+++ b/src/kboot_gpu.c
@@ -3942,6 +3942,10 @@ static const struct {
     {{0x4976c, 0x49eac, 0x9d1ec, 0x9d92c},
      {0xb5, 0x53, 0x7c, 0x8f, 0x06, 0xbd, 0x19, 0xeb, 0xf0, 0xef, 0xd0, 0xcb, 0xfb, 0x65, 0x52, 0x33,
